4. Added the font variables directly in the CSS
5. Simplified the wrapper structure while maintaining the core functionality

This approach should resolve the error because:
1. We're no longer trying to use Next.js font features in the preview environment
2. We've maintained the essential structure and props handling
3. We're still providing the necessary font variables through CSS
4. The component will still handle license requirements and other basic functionality

